# SDK workspace-transaction journals are runtime state, not tracked data.
# pm health fails closed on these (tracked_runtime_cache_files), so committing
# one turns the health gate red; the journal has no value once the transaction
# has landed. Deliberately outside any `pm-cli:` fence, which the CLI rewrites.
.agents/pm/transactions/

# Lossless merge receipts are clone-local evidence (pm merge report lists
# evidence_source: clone_local). Committing them leaves stale hash-only stubs
# that the newer pm binary flags as merge_receipts_pending (gate_failing), and
# `pm merge reconcile` cannot prove them (value_availability: hash_only). They
# have no value once the merge has landed. Deliberately outside any `pm-cli:`
# fence, which the CLI rewrites.
.agents/pm/merge-receipts/
